<Base title="Privacy and cookies" description="Labs uses no analytics, no cookies and no local storage.">
  <h1>Privacy and cookies</h1>
  <p>This site uses <strong>no cookies, no analytics and no local storage</strong>, and loads no third-party scripts. Your slider settings exist only in your browser tab and disappear when you leave.</p>
  <p>The hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and page requested) for security and reliability. If analytics are added later, this page will be updated first and any tool will be privacy-respecting.</p>
  <p>If you email feedback, I will use your message only to reply and improve the labs.</p>
</Base>
